Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:41.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}一如既往的理科教室
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:45.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}熱鬧哄吵的全員大聚集
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:48.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}絲襪精就在一邊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:52.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}旁邊是機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:55.50,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}在最棒的發明上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.78,0:10:59.70,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}寄託自己的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:05.28,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}連傳達不到願望也一定能夠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:08.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}實現吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:13.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}My Pace Science
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:18.04,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}重複不斷的實驗
